      "title": "What Do You See?",
      "type": "story",
      "src": "PDF tr.96",
      "text": "I see a panda.\nThe panda sees a bear.\nThe bear is jumping over a rock.\n\nI see a bear.\nThe bear sees a gorilla.\nThe gorilla is swinging in a tree.\n\nI see a gorilla.\nThe gorilla sees a bird.\nThe bird is flying in the sky.\n\nI see a bird.\nThe bird sees a tiger.\nThe tiger is running in the grass.\n\nI see a tiger.\nThe tiger sees a snake.\nThe snake is sliding down a tree.\n\nI see a snake.\nThe snake sees a girl.\nThe girl is sitting on a rock.\n\nLittle girl, little girl, what do you see?\nI see a girl looking back at me!\n\nThe End",
      "qs": [
